{"speciesId":473,"names":{"fr":"Mammochon","es":"Mamoswine","en":"Mamoswine","ja":"マンムー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A frozen one was dug up from soil dating back 10,000 years. It woke up to much amazement."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"A frozen MAMOSWINE was dug from ice dating back 10,000 years. This Pokémon has been around a long, long, long time."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It flourished worldwide during the ice age but its population declined when the masses of ice began to dwindle."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On a libéré un spécimen de sa prison glacée au bout de 10 000 ans. Il n’en revenait pas."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A frozen one was dug up from soil dating back 10,000 years. It woke up to much amazement."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On a libéré un spécimen de sa prison glacée au bout de 10 000 ans. Il n’en revenait pas."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A frozen one was dug up from soil dating back 10,000 years. It woke up to much amazement."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When the temperature rose at the end of the ice age, most Mamoswine disappeared."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When the temperature rose at the end of the ice age, most Mamoswine disappeared."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon si vieux qu’on l’a découvert sous des glaces vieilles de 10 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Ya existía en la antigüedad. Se encontró uno bajo hielo de hace más de 10 000 años."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A frozen Mamoswine was dug from ice dating back 10,000 years. This Pokémon has been around a long, long, long time."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"１万年前の 氷の 下から 発見された ことも あるほど 大昔から いた ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses défenses spectaculaires sont glacées. Il a failli disparaître dans la canicule suivant l’ère glaciaire."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus impresionantes colmillos están hechos de hielo. Su población se redujo tras la glaciación."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"氷で できた 立派な キバ。 氷河期が 終わり 暖かく なったため 数が 減ってしまった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon si vieux qu’on l’a découvert sous des glaces vieilles de 10 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ya existía en la antigüedad. Se encontró uno bajo hielo de hace más de 10 000 años."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A frozen Mamoswine was dug from ice dating back 10,000 years. This Pokémon has been around a long, long, long time."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"１万年前の 氷の 下から 発見された ことも あるほど 大昔から いた ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses défenses spectaculaires sont glacées. Il a failli disparaître dans la canicule suivant l’ère glaciaire."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus impresionantes colmillos están hechos de hielo. Su población se redujo tras la glaciación."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"氷で できた 立派な キバ。 氷河期が 終わり 暖かく なったため 数が 減ってしまった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On le retrouve dessiné sur des fresques murales vieilles de 10 000 ans. On a cru pendant un temps que son espèce s’était éteinte."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Aparece representado en pinturas rupestres de hace 10 000 años. Hubo un tiempo en el que se lo consideró extinto."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon can be spotted in wall paintings from as far back as 10,000 years ago. For a while, it was thought to have gone extinct."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"１万年前の 壁画にも 描かれている。 絶滅したと 考えられていた 時期もある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Comme son physique le laisse deviner, il est très fort. La taille de ses défenses de glace augmente à mesure que la température baisse."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es tan fuerte como parece. Cuanto más frío hace, más gruesos, largos e imponentes se vuelven sus colmillos de hielo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It looks strong, and that’s exactly what it is. As the weather grows colder, its ice tusks grow longer, thicker, and more impressive."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"見た目どおりの 力持ち。 氷の牙は 寒くなるほど 太く 長く 立派に なる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"This species reached its zenith during the period known as the ice age. I suspect that Hisui's frigid climate is in harmony with Mamoswine's constitution, thus awakening hidden potential."}],"varieties":[{"id":473,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[8,"level-up",32],[9,"level-up",32],[10,"level-up",32],[11,"level-up",32],[14,"level-up",28],[15,"level-up",28],[16,"level-up",28],[17,"level-up",28],[18,"level-up",28],[20,"level-up",44],[23,"level-up",44],[25,"level-up",44],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[14,"level-up",41],[15,"level-up",41],[16,"level-up",41],[17,"level-up",41],[18,"level-up",41],[20,"level-up",65],[23,"level-up",65],[25,"level-up",65],[32,"train",0]]},{"nam